{"speciesId":478,"names":{"fr":"Momartik","es":"Froslass","en":"Froslass","ja":"ユキメノコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as FROSLASS."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as FROSLASS"},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit que Momartik gèle ses proies grâce à son souffle à -50 °C avant de les exposer dans sa tanière."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On dit que Momartik gèle ses proies grâce à son souffle à -50 °C avant de les exposer dans sa tanière."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Momartik gèle ses ennemis grâce à son souffle à -50 °C. Ça ne se voit pas, mais son corps est creux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Congela a sus enemigos con un aliento gélido de -50 °C. Su cuerpo está hueco."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees Fahrenheit. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"マイナス５０度の 冷気を 吐いて 相手を 凍らせる。胴体に 見える 部分は じつは 空洞。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit dans les régions enneigées qu’il s’agit de la réincarnation d’une jeune fille disparue dans les neiges."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que es la reencarnación de mujeres que sufrieron accidentes en la nieve."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as Froslass."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"雪山で 遭難した 女性の 生まれ変わりという 言い伝えが 雪の 多い 土地に 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Momartik gèle ses ennemis grâce à son souffle à -50 °C. Ça ne se voit pas, mais son corps est creux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Congela a sus enemigos con un aliento gélido de -50 °C. Su cuerpo está hueco."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees Fahrenheit. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"マイナス５０度の 冷気を 吐いて 相手を 凍らせる。胴体に 見える 部分は じつは 空洞。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit dans les régions enneigées qu’il s’agit de la réincarnation d’une jeune fille disparue dans les neiges."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que es la reencarnación de mujeres que sufrieron accidentes en la nieve."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as Froslass."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"雪山で 遭難した 女性の 生まれ変わりという 言い伝えが 雪の 多い 土地に 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il congèle les humains et les Pokémon qui lui plaisent. Il les emporte ensuite dans sa tanière pour les admirer à loisir."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Con su gélido aliento congela a todo Pokémon o humano que le llame la atención y se lo lleva a su guarida para usarlo como objeto decorativo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it finds humans or Pokémon it likes, it freezes them and takes them to its chilly den, where they become decorations."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"気に入った 人間や ポケモンを 冷気で 凍らせる。 巣穴に 持って帰って 飾るのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il s’agirait d’une stalagmite possédée par l’âme d’une jeune fille disparue dans les cimes enneigées. Il adore les âmes d’hommes."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que es la reencarnación de mujeres que sufrieron accidentes en la nieve. Siente predilección por las almas masculinas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The soul of a woman lost on a snowy mountain possessed an icicle, becoming this Pokémon. The food it most relishes is the souls of men."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"雪山で 遭難した 女性の 魂が 氷柱に 乗り移った。 男性の 魂が 好物。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Momartik gèle les Montagnards qui s’aventurent dans les pics enneigés et emmène ceux qu’il trouve beaux dans sa tanière."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Congela a los hombres que se aventuran en las cimas nevadas y se los lleva a su guarida, pero tan solo a aquellos que considera apuestos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It freezes hikers who have come to climb snowy mountains and carries them back to its home. It only goes after men it thinks are handsome."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"雪山登山に 来た 山男を 氷漬けにし 棲家に 持ち帰る。 美男子 しか 狙われない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On dit qu’il apparaît dans les zones habitées les soirs de tempête de neige. Si vous entendez toquer à la porte, n’allez pas ouvrir !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se dice que aparece de noche en poblaciones tras una intensa ventisca. Si llama a la puerta, no se le debe abrir bajo ningún concepto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s said that on nights of terrible blizzards, it comes down to human settlements. If you hear it knocking at your door, do not open it!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ひどい 吹雪の 晩に 人里に 下りてくると いう。 ノックされても ドアを 開けては いけないぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon est né des regrets d’une femme disparue dans les pics enneigés. Il raffole des âmes gelées."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Nació del resentimiento de mujeres fallecidas en montañas nevadas. Su manjar predilecto son las almas congeladas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After a woman met her end on a snowy mountain, her regrets lingered on. From them, this Pokémon was born. Its favorite food is frozen souls."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"雪山で 亡くなった 女の 無念から 生まれた ポケモン。 凍らせた 魂が 好物。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il gèle ses proies avec son souffle à - 50 °C, les amène dans son antre, puis les y aligne avec soin."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Expulsa un vaho gélido a -50 °C con el que congela a sus presas para luego llevarlas a su morada y colocarlas como adorno."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It spits out cold air of nearly −60 degrees Fahrenheit to freeze its quarry. It brings frozen prey back to its lair and neatly lines them up."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"マイナス５０度の 冷気を 吐き 凍らせた 獲物を すみかに 持ち帰り きれいに 並べる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A Pokémon inhabited by the soul of a woman who died bearing a grudge in the snowy mountains. Legends of Froslass placing deathly curses on misbehaving men send shivers down my spine."}],"varieties":[{"id":478,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[2